    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d674-a1">

                <pb facs="0798" n="1632" xml:id="pg1632"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Swiss Department of Public
                            Economy to the American Legation
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 6349</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berne</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-06-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 7, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Swiss Department of Public Economy has the honor to bring to the knowledge of
                    the Legation of the United States of America that the Federal Council has
                    ratified the convention relative to lumber, as well as the minutes of the last
                    conference, concluded on May 1, 1918, between the delegates of the Allied
                    Governments and those of the Federal Government.</p>
                <p>The Department avails itself of this occasion to renew to the Legation of the
                    United States of America the assurance of its high esteem.</p>
            </div>
